        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/ce648a17cda4e9dfa7c5eaa23bdd34fb.avif?t=1757056483\" width=425 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 In this relaxing cat-filled game, are you ready to discover 100 hidden cats across the unique landscapes of the country? Hand-drawn scenes with colorful streets, historic landmarks, and cultural icons await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/6d52a3b7cc56ea60fb78be0318843ab9.avif?t=1757056483\" width=425 height=150 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.poster.avif?t=1757056483\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.webm?t=1757056483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/dd82c0243910a8d6a09ff220ca07bf43.mp4?t=1757056483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🔎 After finding the cats, 🎨 a relaxing coloring experience awaits. The game offers only color-by-numbers mode, letting you easily bring each scene to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extras/f4977150f0bfbb5b0a09db09010ab471.avif?t=1757056483\" width=425 height=150 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766210/extr